  "notes": "Agent re-read after the Code Health refactor, 2026-11-07, under the owner directive transcribed in verification/reviews/rulings/agent-rereview-after-refactor-2026-11-07.md. This record is NOT an owner signature: it attests the agent's substantive reading only. Read proxy.signing_credential_provenance. app.rs became app.rs plus app/{boot,planes,...}.rs. The root still opens its one key source through the materializer: boot::preflight calls build_key_source and then the two eager fallible reads roots.channel_credential() and roots.response_public_key() (planes::install_trust), each mapped to an error string that refuses boot; planes::install_signing moves the same MaterializedSigningRoles witness into SigningPlane::materialize. A search of app.rs and app/ finds no FileKeySource, AwsKms, GcpKms or Pkcs11 constructor, so the root builds no key source of its own. SigningPlane::materialize still takes the witness by type; the only change in signing_plane/mod.rs is a test-side RotationScope argument. signing_credential_provenance_test.rs now reads the composition through composition_source::composition_production(), which concatenates the production half of app.rs and every app/*.rs in path order, so each guard still scans the whole root. The claim, scope and premises are unchanged. Evidence class as registered; V0 units are tested and probed, not machine-checked proofs. The mutation lane was not re-run by this reading; check-registries resolves every probe anchor.",
